      "writtenOn": "2021-01-28T18:22:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On receiving an exit mode request, EC sends\n1. Disconnect mode - https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2643523/8/common/usbc/tbt_alt_mode.c#491\n2. Sends exit mode to port partner. \n3. On Ack/Nack, sets mux to USB mode(same as TOT) - https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/2643523/8/common/usbc/tbt_alt_mode.c#269",
